    "identifier": "akimichi-empty-crash",
    "description": "<p>You smash the ground upheaving chunks of stone and hurling them towards a target creature within range. Make a ranged Taijutsu attack. On a Hit you deal 5d6 Bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. You enlarge your striking limb before striking the ground. The terrain is left asunder. Select a point connected to the space you are in or the space the target creature is in. A 30-foot cube centered on that point becomes difficult terrain.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the Chakra cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6. If this Jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the Calorie cost by +1.</p>",
